  "description": "College life should have been simple, but living with Woo-Hee is torture for Jin-Ha. His closest friend is now the object of every forbidden thought, and the walls of their dorm can no longer keep his desire at bay. When one reckless night strips away the safety of silence, the truth between them comes alive in heat and hunger. What was once friendship transforms into something far more intimate, where every touch carries the weight of years of longing.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
